# Sources clang-format must never touch: vendored code keeps its
# upstream formatting so future drops diff cleanly, and generated files
# are owned by their generators (regenerating would discard any
# reformat). The tree holds neither today — nothing is vendored, and
# every generated source is written into the build tree, which is not
# checked — so this file carries no patterns and is the place a new one
# goes. clang-format 18+ honors this file; scripts/check.py applies the
# same exclusions in its own file selection.
